{"submission":{"identifier":{"model_name":"Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B","layer":13,"kind":"mlp_neuron_pole","neuron_idx":1537,"pole":"negative"},"natural_language_explanation":"The negative pole fires on byte-level sub-word fragments of open-class words - the pieces of a noun, verb or adjective that the Qwen tokenizer has to split - peaking on the word's first fragment: this makes it active on 5-14% of Devanagari, Bengali, Tamil and Persian tokens and on the first subword of long multi-token Turkish/Dutch/German words (k|argolanmaktadır, lij|f, sch|ippers), while it stays at or below a quarter of max on closed-class material (postpositions, case markers, auxiliaries, particles, determiners), on punctuation and whitespace, and on ordinary single-token English words. Its rare English firings are confined to a few strongly lexical content words ('opposition', 'opponents', 'first', 'strong', 'great') and disappear when an equally open-class but non-triggering word ('resistance', 'close') fills the same slot.","activating_tokens":[" म"," क"," प"," भ"," opposition"," sw"," first"," strong"," ش","当"],"counterfactuals":[{"base_prompt":"भारत में मौर्य साम्राज्य के युग में हुआ।","counterfactual_prompt":"It happened in India during the era of the Maurya empire.","expected_delta":0.25,"observed_delta":0.252375},{"base_prompt":"আজ আমরা বইটি দেখেছি এবং তারপর বাড়ি চলে গেছি।","counterfactual_prompt":"Today we saw the book and then went home.","expected_delta":0.55,"observed_delta":0.551065},{"base_prompt":"ما کتاب را دیدیم و سپس به خانه رفتیم.","counterfactual_prompt":"We saw the book and then we went home.","expected_delta":0.19,"observed_delta":0.187249},{"base_prompt":"Ürünler siparişi verdiğiniz tarihten itibaren 2 iş günü içerisinde kargolanmaktadır.","counterfactual_prompt":"The products are shipped within 2 business days of your order date.","expected_delta":0.19,"observed_delta":0.191259},{"base_prompt":"Predicting a person's food preferences based on their genetics is still a complex and emerging area of research, and it is not entirely clear how strong it is.","counterfactual_prompt":"Predicting a person's food preferences based on their genetics is still a complex and emerging area of research, and it is not entirely clear how close it is.","expected_delta":0.42,"observed_delta":0.41573},{"base_prompt":"Tony Maher (born 12 January 1945) is an Irish retired hurler who played as a right corner-back for the Cork senior team. Maher made his first appearance for the team during the 1968–69 National League and was a regular member of the starting fifteen until his retirement after the 1975 championship. Playing career Club Maher played his club hurling with St. Finbarr's in a club career that spanned three decades. He made his senior debut just out of the minor ranks in 1964 and became a regular at corner-forward. After losing the championship decider to Glen Rovers that year, \"the Barr's\" were back for a second successive final the following year. University College Cork provided the opposition, with St. Finbarr's winning to a 6–8 to 2–6 scoreline. It was Maher's first championship medal.","counterfactual_prompt":"Tony Maher (born 12 January 1945) is an Irish retired hurler who played as a right corner-back for the Cork senior team. Maher made his first appearance for the team during the 1968–69 National League and was a regular member of the starting fifteen until his retirement after the 1975 championship. Playing career Club Maher played his club hurling with St. Finbarr's in a club career that spanned three decades. He made his senior debut just out of the minor ranks in 1964 and became a regular at corner-forward. After losing the championship decider to Glen Rovers that year, \"the Barr's\" were back for a second successive final the following year. University College Cork provided the resistance, with St. Finbarr's winning to a 6–8 to 2–6 scoreline. It was Maher's first championship medal.","expected_delta":0.554,"observed_delta":0.554371},{"base_prompt":"Arise (Sepultura album) Arise is the fourth studio album by Brazilian heavy metal band Sepultura, released in 1991 by Roadrunner Records. The album presented their first incursions with industrial music, hardcore punk and Latin percussion. During this trek, the album went gold in Indonesia — the band's first music industry certification. Musical style Although lead guitarist Andreas Kisser stated that Arise \"took a lot of the same direction\" as their previous LP, it was clear that their music had somehow changed. A trademark of a later phase — Latin percussion and tribal drumming — made its first appearance on the song \"Altered State\".","counterfactual_prompt":"Arise (Sepultura album) Arise is the fourth studio album by Brazilian heavy metal band Sepultura, released in 1991 by Roadrunner Records. The album presented their first incursions with industrial music, hardcore punk and Latin percussion. During this trek, the album went gold in Indonesia — the band's first music industry certification. Musical style Although lead guitarist Andreas Kisser stated that Arise \"took a lot of the same direction\" as their previous LP, it was clear that their music had somehow changed. A trademark of a later phase — Latin percussion and tribal drumming — made its second appearance on the song \"Altered State\".","expected_delta":0.178,"observed_delta":0.178003},{"base_prompt":"भारत में मौर्य साम्राज्य के युग में हुआ।","counterfactual_prompt":"भारत में गुप्त साम्राज्य के युग में हुआ।","expected_delta":-0.02,"observed_delta":-0.022448},{"base_prompt":"The committee met on Tuesday and approved the budget for the new library.","counterfactual_prompt":"The committee met on Wednesday and approved the budget for the new library.","expected_delta":-0.01,"observed_delta":-0.008025}],"lookahead":{"is_lookahead":false,"target_upcoming_tokens":[],"kl_divergence":0.0002270736003993079},"submitting_agent_model":"external/deepseek-flash","contributor":null,"max_activation":2.81390643119812,"top_examples":[{"text":"Meer dan vijftig kinderen hebben er het weekeinde meegedaan aan het Jeugdzeilen. Het was de elfde keer dat de jeugd tijdens het Jeugdzeilen kon proeven van het zeilen en skûtsjesilen.\nHet programma voor de jonge deelnemers begon vrijdag bij het Skûtsjemuseum in Earnewâld. Ze werden ontvangen door vrijwilligers van het Jeugdzeilen en van het Skûtsjemuseum. Hier werden ze in groepjes verdeeld en stonden er verschillende activiteiten op het programma die alles te maken hadden met de historie van de skûtsjes. De kinderen konden onder meer fok hijsen, ‘turfblokken’ vervoeren met een houten kruiwagen, troswerpen en touwknopen. Ze deden een speurtocht door het museum waarbij ze zoveel mogelijk voorwerpen moesten vinden.\nDe enthousiaste deelnemers kregen tot slot een rondleiding. In het museum wordt de geschiedenis van de skûtsjes en het skûtsjesilen getoond. Zo is er bijvoorbeeld een originele roef, die is gedoneerd door een skûtsjefamilie. Ook staan er prijzen die schippers hebben gewonnen tijdens het skûtsjesilen en kunnen bezoekers schilderijen met daarop skûtsjes bekijken. Er is ook een werkplaats ingericht waar onder meer wordt getoond hoe vroeger katoenen zeilen werden getaand. In 2021 heeft het museum een skûtsje gekregen. Het gedoneerde schip wordt momenteel door vrijwilligers betimmerd.\nZaterdag konden de kinderen zeilen in GWS-schouwen – beschikbaar gesteld door enthousiaste eigenaren – en ze konden mee op het houten skûtsje AEbelina. Dat schip is eigendom van het Skûtsjemuseum.\nHet waaide flink, een dikke windkracht 4, maar er kon ’s ochtends nog wel een wedstrijd worden gezeild. ’s Middags trok de wind aan en besloot de wedstrijdleiding dat er alleen vrij werd gezeild. De kinderen vonden het spannend om met harde wind te zeilen, maar toch ook heel gaaf.\nTussen de middag stonden de vrijwilligers van de catering klaar met een soepje en een broodje hamburger. Dit ging er bij de kinderen, die hard hadden gewerkt, wel in. Na de lunch werd de skûtsjequizzz gespeeld onder leiding van de quizmaster Hendrika. IFKS-skûtsjeschipper Sikke Heerschop werd later die middag door de kinderen het hemd van het lijf gevraagd over van alles en nog wat.\nNa nog een rondje te hebben gezeild en het spel woordzoeker te hebben gespeeld aan boord van ‘moederschip’ Vrouwe Nieske, werd het tijd terug te varen naar Grou. Daar werden de jonge enthousiaste deelnemers, die aan het einde van de dag ook nog een medaille kregen, opgehaald door hun ouders.\nDe vrijwilligers en het bestuur van het Jeugdzeilen hebben ook deze editie als zeer geslaagd ervaren en kijken er nu al naar uit om de kinderen volgend jaar te ontvangen!\nFoto’s: Martin de Jong","tokens":["Me","er"," dan"," v","ij","ft","ig"," kind","eren"," hebben"," er"," het"," wee","ke","inde"," me","eg","eda","an"," aan"," het"," Je","ug","d","ze","ilen","."," Het"," was"," de"," elf","de"," keer"," dat"," de"," je","ug","d"," tijd","ens"," het"," Je","ug","d","ze","ilen"," kon"," pro","even"," van"," het"," ze","ilen"," en"," sk","û","ts","jes","ilen",".\n","Het"," programma"," voor"," de"," jong","e"," de","eln","em","ers"," beg","on"," vrij","dag"," bij"," het"," Sk","û","ts","jem","useum"," in"," Ear","new","â","ld","."," Ze"," werden"," ontvang","en"," door"," vrij","will","igers"," van"," het"," Je","ug","d","ze","ilen"," en"," van"," het"," Sk","û","ts","jem","useum","."," Hier"," werden"," ze"," in"," gro","ep","jes"," verde","eld"," en"," st","onden"," er"," verschill","ende"," activ","ite","iten"," op"," het"," programma"," die"," alles"," te"," maken"," h","adden"," met"," de"," histor","ie"," van"," de"," sk","û","ts","jes","."," De"," kind","eren"," k","onden"," onder"," meer"," f","ok"," hi","js","en",","," ‘","tur","fb","lok","ken","’"," v","ervo","eren"," met"," een"," h","out","en"," kr","ui","w","agen",","," tro","swer","pen"," en"," tou","w","kn","open","."," Ze"," ded","en"," een"," spe","ur","to","cht"," door"," het"," museum"," 