ths of repairs, and by noon the reading room was full. Volunteers had spent the spring sorting boxes that had sat in the basement since the flood, and a local carpenter rebuilt the shelves himself. Children crowded around the new picture books while their parents drank tea from paper cups and talked about the weather. Nobody mentioned the budget, or the argument about the roof, or the letter that had been sent to the council last autumn. Outside, the rain finally stopped, and a thin band of sunlight crossed the floor. The librarian, who had worked there for thirty-one years, said she had never seen so many people in one morning. By four o'clock most of them had gone home, and the building was quiet again.","passed":true,"expected_active":false,"activation":0.270646,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"A long-context English passage whose split words (carpenter, shuffling) and single-token words are all outside the few lexical exceptions the hypothesis confines English firing to.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"खबर:\nबच्चों ने मैदान में क्रिकेट खेला और शाम तक घर नहीं लौटे।","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.039012,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Novel Hindi sentence whose open-class nouns and verb tokenize as multi-piece Devanagari fragments, which the hypothesis predicts fire on their first fragments.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"आज काठमाडौंमा हल्का वर्षा भएको छ।","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.629883,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Devanagari in a different language (Nepali) and genre from the Hindi examples, testing the hypothesis's claim that the feature is script-based rather than Hindi-specific.","measured":true},{"kind":"positive_holdout","prompt":"বইমেলায় নতুন লেখকদের উপন্যাস বিক্রি হচ্ছে।","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.063282,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Novel Beng